    "Bundles group several skills under one `/<name>` command. Create them with `hermes bundles create`; they live in ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/.": {
      "comment": "A description of the purpose of the \"Skill Bundles\" feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundles fassen mehrere Skills unter einem `/<name>`-Befehl zusammen. Erstelle sie mit `hermes bundles create`; sie liegen unter ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los paquetes agrupan varias habilidades bajo un único comando `/<name>`. Créalos con `hermes bundles create`; residen en ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bundles regroupent plusieurs compétences sous une seule commande `/<name>`. Créez-les avec `hermes bundles create` ; ils résident dans ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バンドルは複数のスキルを 1 つの `/<name>` コマンドにまとめます。`hermes bundles create` で作成してください。~/.hermes/skill-bundles/ に配置されます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pacotes agrupam várias habilidades sob um único comando `/<name>`. Crie-os com `hermes bundles create`; eles ficam em ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "捆绑包(Bundles)将多个技能归入一个 `/<name>` 命令下。使用 `hermes bundles create` 创建它们;它们存放在 ~/.hermes/skill-bundles/ 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
