    "Forwarding via %@. Use any bearer token in your client — the proxy attaches your real credential.": {
      "comment": "A footnote that describes how the Hermes Proxy is forwarding requests to a specific provider.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
